{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1101862-could-this-work-in-beast","id":1101862,"title":"Could this work in Beast","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-08T22:49:21-07:00","id":1101862,"title":"Could this work in Beast","content":"I am curious about something, Awhile ago i came up with an antagonist idea for a fan splat that was being worked on here on the forums but scrapped it in favor for another. My idea was a corporation that somehow found a way to enter the dreams of people and uses it as a way to take out competitors and other stuff. I am wondering if that idea could work in Beast and if so, how can it be done?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-08T23:59:04-07:00","id":1101877,"title":"","content":"I can see two &quot;easy&quot; ways this could be done. <br /> 1. Using nightmares on your competitors and setting them to happen in your enemies sleep.<br /> 2. Have your horror stalk the hive until they find the targets dreams and specifically feed on their terror. This would probably take a decent amount of time to do because of the nature of the primordial dream, but maybe that business's begotten have a nightmare which makes that person create a signature &quot;ripple&quot; in the dream which increases the chances of your horror finding their dream to feast on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-09T03:20:28-07:00","id":1101906,"title":"","content":"I could actually see this as a REALLY Creepy enemy to face in the Primodial Dream or the Local Hive. Imagine if you will Going into a building or party and finding the same repeated action amongst the local Populace. The same imagery, same patterns same three lines of dialogue. Now imagine going into the hive and finding the same Patterns and dialogue... and the Hive is reacting to it.<br /> The Race would be on to find out who is Manipulating the Dreams of the people and Warping the hive into something for them too use. What are they doing? How are they doing it? What is the end Goal? And why are Dreamers starting to pay attention to you more in the waking world?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-09T18:24:56-07:00","id":1102166,"title":"","content":"My idea for the actual dream infiltration is this. Basically, the company discovered that a new drug they made called Moonbeam had a unusual side affect on some people. The drug, which was first made to help insomniacs sleep, caused some people to have lucid dreams. Some of these lucid dreamers then discovered that they could rip holes into the Primordial Dream and use it as a way to infiltrate the dreams of rival company executives. Crescent, the name of this antagonist company, realized that they could destroy their competitors by driving their executives stark raving mad. So, they pretty started a secret project within the company that did two things, research the PD and dream infiltration, unaware that the PD is already a inhabited ecosystem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T00:39:45-07:00","id":1143991,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1101862-could-this-work-in-beast?p=1102166#post1102166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My idea for the actual dream infiltration is this. Basically, the company discovered that a new drug they made called Moonbeam had a unusual side affect on some people. The drug, which was first made to help insomniacs sleep, caused some people to have lucid dreams. Some of these lucid dreamers then discovered that they could rip holes into the Primordial Dream and use it as a way to infiltrate the dreams of rival company executives. Crescent, the name of this antagonist company, realized that they could destroy their competitors by driving their executives stark raving mad. So, they pretty started a secret project within the company that did two things, research the PD and dream infiltration, unaware that the PD is already a inhabited ecosystem.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like the Merrick Institute combined with the Conspiracy from Persona 5 (apologies for maybe spoiler.)<br /> Sounds interesting Killerclown <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}